Z||000001||rogergarrison||09-06-2001||10:05 AM||||Prob just one of the Mark Series coupes. I used to buy lots of Lincolns from 57 up. I never saw one with a factory turbo. Most real old ones are just huge block (460,430. with 400 hp who needs turbo)newer ones are 5.0 and the 4.9 even the small new model doesnt have a turbo as far as I know.<P>Prob just stuck the emblem on like the riceguys and their decals.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 09-06-2001).]||||reg||1
